<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in heavy trading on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 153.80 to 7758.06.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 7.68 to 466.17.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.73.</p>
<p>Advancers beat decliners 1787 to 962.</p>
<p>Volume was 542,647,720 compared with 492,692,680 on Monday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1645 EST/2045 GMT).</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
